  "comment": "App base runtime (Expo SDK 58): a product-grade UI kit (src/ui), on-device persistence (src/modules/persist.ts), Skia + Reanimated + Gesture Handler, haptics and subtle sounds (src/audio). Apps are built ON this kit — never with raw unstyled Views/system fonts. src/modules/{ads,iap,store,analytics} are the monetization + telemetry layer and must stay. scripts/journeys.ts is factory-owned."
